     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>此篇其實比較像是詢問意見(老師臨時丟給我支線任務)</div><div><br></div><div>P.S : 單純的討論串 ...，越神奇、越狂、越漂亮的寫法無限歡迎 !!!!! 歡迎各位神人大大(跪)</div><div><br></div>以前都是單純的分析資料，還沒有碰過所給類似地圖座標，進行視覺化分析(所以一開始看到有愣住)。<div><br></div><div>遇到這樣份量的生肉有被嚇到，不過剛剛看過資料貌似不用在額外清洗了 ...</div><div><br></div><div>我想知道有什麼工具有利於進行這類的分析 </div><div><br></div><div>例如剛剛找的這個 ....</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RgoogleMaps/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RgoogleMaps/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237788919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1knuuK4_SyFyUzZJTpVqWC\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RgoogleMaps/index.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://www.r-bloggers.com/using-google-maps-api-and-r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-bloggers.com/using-google-maps-api-and-r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237788919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3G6k_VnyunKeCIp2polm2J\">https://www.r-bloggers.com/using-google-maps-api-and-r</a>/<br></div><div><br></div><div>總覺不太行 ...(嘆)</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v2jDmKaDQTI/WJeI2ZXqbaI/AAAAAAAACfs/_0KRY2tcsq4yjo0tTBS0cWYqGmdIftvpwCLcB/s1600/XXX.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v2jDmKaDQTI/WJeI2ZXqbaI/AAAAAAAACfs/_0KRY2tcsq4yjo0tTBS0cWYqGmdIftvpwCLcB/s1600/XXX.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237788919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29W4AxYYne3xBLyO24jijs\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-v2jDmKaDQTI/WJeI2ZXqbaI/AAAAAAAACfs/_0KRY2tcsq4yjo0tTBS0cWYqGmdIftvpwCLcB/s1600/XXX.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PbBIihV8NCQ/WJeLMhFJF-I/AAAAAAAACf4/dKmt2brjsm8wFtdHH8zGPsIU_FdLwxrggCLcB/s1600/123456789.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PbBIihV8NCQ/WJeLMhFJF-I/AAAAAAAACf4/dKmt2brjsm8wFtdHH8zGPsIU_FdLwxrggCLcB/s1600/123456789.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237788919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2x9Vq8l3Cch6pDKLB6KGO5\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PbBIihV8NCQ/WJeLMhFJF-I/AAAAAAAACf4/dKmt2brjsm8wFtdHH8zGPsIU_FdLwxrggCLcB/s1600/123456789.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>這份是有人做過的東西，不過這個人是用 python 寫的....(詳見 sol.pdf)，我認為既然 python 寫的出來 R 也可以 !!!!(勿戰)</div><div><br></div><div>如果我自己有想到方法我會放在下面回覆。</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
